{"id":"wb-6-560","name":"玉山古茶场","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"玉山古茶场","text":"玉山古茶场位于中国浙江省磐安县玉山镇马塘村茶场山下，2006年被列为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。\n茶场始建于宋代，现存建筑为清乾隆四十六年（1781年）重修。主要建筑有茶场庙、巡检司、茶场三大部分，占地3430平方米，建筑面积1544平方米。玉山古茶场集生产、交易、祭祀于一体，为中国国内所仅见。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%8E%89%E5%B1%B1%E5%8F%A4%E8%8C%B6%E5%9C%BA","revisionId":91657287,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91657287","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/2efb01a9e8ba80f94d7e9b7a.jpg","title":"Yushan_Ancient_Tea_Plantation_02_2023-07.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Yushan_Ancient_Tea_Plantation_02_2023-07.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e9/Yushan_Ancient_Tea_Plantation_02_2023-07.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"猫猫的日记本","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​玉山古茶场，大门（朝向西南）。","width":320,"height":213}}